<div class="page-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">POSLOVNA EVIDENCIJA</p><h1>Izvještaji i izvoz</h1><p>Lager, promet robe i ručno evidentirane finansijske radnje.</p></div></div>
<section class="panel"><form class="admin-filters" method="get"><input type="hidden" name="page" value="reports"><div><?php field('from','Od datuma',$from,'date');?></div><div><?php field('to','Do datuma (uključivo)',$to,'date');?></div><?php if(can('inventory')):?><div><?php $opts=[0=>'Svi artikli'];foreach(query('SELECT id,sku,name FROM products ORDER BY sku')->fetchAll() as $p)$opts[$p['id']]=$p['sku'].' · '.$p['name'];selectField('product','Kartica artikla',$opts,$product);?></div><?php endif;?><button>Prikaži</button></form></section>
<?php if(can('inventory')):$stock=query('SELECT COALESCE(SUM(stock+reserved),0) physical,COALESCE(SUM(reserved),0) reserved,COALESCE(SUM((stock+reserved)*purchase_price),0) value,COALESCE(SUM((stock+reserved)>0 AND purchase_price=0),0) unpriced FROM products')->fetch();?><section class="panel"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Trenutno stanje lagera</h2><p>Presjek u trenutku otvaranja stranice, bez obzira na odabrani period.</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="?page=reports&export=stock">Lagerlista CSV ↗</a></div><div class="report-totals"><div><span>Fizičko stanje</span><strong><?=$stock['physical']?> kom.</strong></div><div><span>Rezervisano</span><strong><?=$stock['reserved']?> kom.</strong></div><div><span>Nabavna vrijednost</span><strong><?=money((float)$stock['value'])?></strong></div></div><p class="field-help">Vrijednost po trenutnoj nabavnoj cijeni, uključuje rezervacije. <?=$stock['unpriced']?> artikala na stanju nema nabavnu cijenu. Nije obračun FIFO-a, prosječne cijene, marže ili PDV-a.</p></section><section class="panel"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Promet lagera u periodu</h2><a class="btn secondary" href="?<?=e(http_build_query(['page'=>'reports','export'=>'movements','from'=>$from,'to'=>$to,'product'=>$product]))?>">Promet CSV ↗</a></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Datum</th><th>Artikal</th><th>Vrsta / dokument</th><th>Promjena</th><th>Slobodno poslije</th><th>Rezervisano poslije</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach(query('SELECT m.*,p.sku FROM stock_movements m JOIN products p ON p.id=m.product_id WHERE m.created_at>=? AND m.created_at<? AND (?=0 OR m.product_id=?) ORDER BY m.id DESC LIMIT 200',[$from,$until,$product,$product])->fetchAll() as $m):?><tr><td><?=e($m['created_at'])?></td><td><?=e($m['sku'])?></td><td><?=e(movementLabel($m['kind']))?><small class="cell-note"><?=e($m['note'])?></small></td><td class="numeric"><?=$m['quantity']?></td><td class="numeric"><?=$m['available_after']??'—'?></td><td class="numeric"><?=$m['reserved_after']??'—'?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div><p class="field-help">Do 200 posljednjih zapisa u periodu. CSV sadrži sve rezultate.</p></section><?php endif;?>
